# StudyPulse AI — Environment Configuration
#
# 1. Get a free Google Gemini API key:
#    https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# 2. Copy this file to ".env" and paste your key below.
# 3. Restart the dev server.
#
# Until a valid key is added, the app runs in DEMO MODE with
# realistic mock content so you can explore every feature.

VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
